"""Separate default-off M2 capture composition for an admitted fresh-task child.

SOURCE CANDIDATE ONLY. There is intentionally no CLI/main entry. The existing
sealed daemon must opt in through a separately reviewed source/request binding
before calling this code with its actual bootstrap result. This module neither
mints bootstrap credentials nor accepts a serialized resource capability.
"""
